#: emails.py
msgid ""
"The customer was not told. Keep it (the card is charged afresh when it "
"closes) or cancel it."
msgstr ""
"No se avisó al cliente. Consérvelo (se hará un nuevo cargo a la tarjeta al "
"cerrarlo) o cancélelo."

