msgid "You don't have permission to perform this action"
msgstr "No tiene permiso para realizar esta acción"

#: graphql/mutations.py
msgid "Only a failed card hold that wasn't kept can be decided."
msgstr ""
"Solo se puede decidir sobre una retención en tarjeta fallida que no se haya "
"conservado."

#: graphql/mutations.py
msgid ""
"Only a partially paid card hold that isn't being charged can be marked paid."
msgstr ""
"Solo se puede marcar como pagada una retención en tarjeta pagada "
"parcialmente que no se esté cobrando."

